{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John, since our last chat, something awesome happened. Last Friday, I started introducing Max, Daisy and the new pup Ned. It was hard at first, but they're slowly adapting. It's sweet to watch them bond and have fun together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-7ac9d97e20883fccd30044b3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.162518+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ac9d97e20883fccd30044b3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ac9d97e20883fccd30044b3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, that's cool, James! Seeing them bonding and having a great time is so sweet. Do you have a picture of them together?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-4be8e3bcd62dac31139cb7e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.185884+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4be8e3bcd62dac31139cb7e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4be8e3bcd62dac31139cb7e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yep, I got a great pic last night. Check it out!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-1d523485ca1bfa987e0b6130", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.202557+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1d523485ca1bfa987e0b6130", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1d523485ca1bfa987e0b6130", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, they look so cute! I can almost feel the love and joy in this photo. These last few days really got me thinking about my own future."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-0918f24253267b0645a38c3c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.216493+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0918f24253267b0645a38c3c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0918f24253267b0645a38c3c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: What's been on your mind regarding the future?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-5d4c79a9ee4bbe94daf14833", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.229948+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5d4c79a9ee4bbe94daf14833", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5d4c79a9ee4bbe94daf14833", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Lately, I've been thinking about my career and where I want to be in the future. I'm driven and passionate, and I also want to make a positive impact on the world."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-a09bce87fe64623982700a26", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.242921+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a09bce87fe64623982700a26", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a09bce87fe64623982700a26", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Gotcha, John. Finding a way to make a difference matters. Have you thought about any ideas on how to do that?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-c4e3223556e1e48954345fa6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.259330+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c4e3223556e1e48954345fa6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c4e3223556e1e48954345fa6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, I have. I've been looking into volunteering and thinking of going into non-profit work. I want to put my passions and abilities to use for causes I really care about."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-13b853265f91a6ecfafe0aa7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.270837+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "13b853265f91a6ecfafe0aa7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "13b853265f91a6ecfafe0aa7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, John that sounds great! I'm sure with your skills and passion, you could do some really cool things with nonprofits. Here's a pic I took when I volunteered last month. It was really rewarding to see how little gifts can do so much!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-0001317fc14a381ad9b4dbdb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.288939+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0001317fc14a381ad9b4dbdb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0001317fc14a381ad9b4dbdb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's awesome, James! Was it cool to see the impact of the gifts? Can you tell me more about the organization you volunteered with?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-1a52208d0bf07048c6d9d28c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.304933+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1a52208d0bf07048c6d9d28c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1a52208d0bf07048c6d9d28c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: It was great to see how much a simple act of kindness can mean to someone in need. I volunteered with an organization that provides necessary items to those who are less fortunate. It felt so rewarding to help, even if it was in a small way."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-21ef7c3580f643ec63902e58", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.320933+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "21ef7c3580f643ec63902e58", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "21ef7c3580f643ec63902e58", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I think this is exactly what I need. Can you take me there this weekend?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-dde5f34e3f33f60d8b740c14", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.339030+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dde5f34e3f33f60d8b740c14", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dde5f34e3f33f60d8b740c14", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Of course I can! I think there are still some of the previous staff there and I can even introduce you to them."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-4adc81c97a1eed702fa689e2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.353510+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4adc81c97a1eed702fa689e2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4adc81c97a1eed702fa689e2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thank you very much! Will there be some kind of interview required?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-aa05e278d467763f9f755d98", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.369616+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa05e278d467763f9f755d98", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa05e278d467763f9f755d98", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: No, this is not necessary. All you need is to be a friendly and polite person, and also have a great desire to help people. I'm sure you will succeed!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-fbe8b945751d32ec7cc74df3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.384065+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fbe8b945751d32ec7cc74df3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fbe8b945751d32ec7cc74df3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for your support! I want to make this world a better place, and with your help I will definitely achieve my goal."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-d2659e23c97b43f1f0485ff8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.401332+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d2659e23c97b43f1f0485ff8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d2659e23c97b43f1f0485ff8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: We can do this together!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-d15d99678304ce27834a0926", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.416833+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d15d99678304ce27834a0926", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d15d99678304ce27834a0926", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, James. Your support means a lot to me. I'm determined to make a positive impact."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-2c5b28faa4b94e1eacce1b07", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.430480+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c5b28faa4b94e1eacce1b07", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c5b28faa4b94e1eacce1b07", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: You got this! Stay focused on your dreams and don't give up."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_15-d5a9f9ba912f6d412d70d7c0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:50:12.446569+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d5a9f9ba912f6d412d70d7c0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d5a9f9ba912f6d412d70d7c0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
